# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Where the Flowers Forget — Vault .gitignore
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit credentials. Covers .env and name.env.
.env
*.env

# Local REST API plugin regenerates an API key + RSA private key into its
# data.json on first Obsidian launch. obsidian-git auto-commits, and this repo
# is PUBLIC — keep that credential local. (Re-pairs itself per machine.)
.obsidian/plugins/obsidian-local-rest-api/data.json

# ── Session Recordings (voices of real people) ────────────────
Session_Sources/Recordings/
*.mp3

# ── Copyrighted D&D Source PDFs ───────────────────────────────
DND_Sources/*.pdf

# ── Auto-fetched DDB party sheets (other players' data) ───────
# ddb_party_sync.js pulls full character sheets players shared only
# "Campaign Only" on D&D Beyond. This repo is PUBLIC — these MUST stay ignored
# so other players' sheets aren't republished to the world.
03-Characters/01 PCs/Party Character Sheets/_raw/
03-Characters/01 PCs/Party Character Sheets/*(DDB).md

# ── DDB party roster (holds players' DDB usernames + user IDs) ─
# --discover writes every member's username/userId here. PUBLIC repo + the
# group's "first names only, no DDB IDs" rule → keep it local. Regenerable
# any time with: node ddb_party_sync.js --discover
Workflows/scripts/ddb_party.json

# ── Misfiled SITL transcripts (WRONG CAMPAIGN — pending removal) ──
# Both of these are Sky Is The Limit sessions (DM Addison, Out of the Abyss) that
# the transcription watcher dropped into this vault on 2026-08-02. They are NOT
# WtFF content. The authoritative copy of the full recording already lives at
# sitl_vault/Session_Sources/Transcripts/Raw_Unedited/21-080226_raw_transcript.md,
# so nothing here is unique. This repo is PUBLIC — committing another campaign's
# 233-minute transcript (players' first names, real-life above-table chat) would
# republish it to the world. Ignored, not deleted: removal is Taylor's call.
# Evidence: _pipeline/S04/flags.md #1. Delete these lines once the files are gone.
Session_Sources/Transcripts/Raw_Unedited/04-080226_raw_transcript.md
Session_Sources/Transcripts/Raw_Unedited/04-UNKNOWN_raw_transcript.md

# ── Obsidian / tooling ────────────────────────────────────────
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache
.smart-env/
.claude/

# ── Pipeline scratch (transient: review files, state, logs, prompts) ──
_pipeline/

# ── Node / OS junk ────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
package-lock.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
